     The bbccmmssttbbggppiioo driver provides support for the GPIO ports found on Broad‐
     com Set-top Box SoCs.  This includes the Broadcom BCM2712 SoC that is
     used in the Raspberry Pi 5.  It does not provide direct device driver en‐
     try points but makes its functions available to other drivers.

